{
  "slug": "hitmaka-gives-jack-harlow-his-flowers-says-he-deserves-everything-coming-his-way",
  "postId": 74643,
  "title": "Hitmaka Gives Jack Harlow His Flowers, Says He Deserves Everything Coming His Way",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></gwmw><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":516498,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/download-43-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-516498\"/><figcaption>Getty Images </figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Jack Harlow arrived at the BET Awards on Sunday evening sporting a Lil Nas T-shirt. Harlow was nominated for best male hip-hop&nbsp;and was scheduled to perform. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>However, Harlow made a statement in favor of his friend, who was not nominated for any categories. Earlier this month, X <a href=\"https://landonbuford.com/2022/06/03/queen-latifah-reacts-to-lil-nas-x-being-snubbed-by-bet/\">took to Twitter </a>and accused the network of participating in the world's problems. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>In response, Lil Nas X shared an image of Harlow <a href=\"https://twitter.com/LilNasX/status/1541187143393067009?s=20&amp;t=pd6i3Is6IqdSYPVpVtJDoQ\">on Twitter</a> with the message, \"Wow I really love this man.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://twitter.com/LilNasX/status/1541187143393067009?s=20u0026t=pd6i3Is6IqdSYPVpVtJDoQ\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"twitter\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-twitter wp-block-embed-twitter\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://twitter.com/LilNasX/status/1541187143393067009?s=20&amp;t=pd6i3Is6IqdSYPVpVtJDoQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Later Sunday evening, <a href=\"https://www.billboard.com/music/awards/jack-harlow-brandy-2022-bet-awards-performance-1235106562/\">according to Billboard</a>, he would invite Lil Wayne, DJ Drama, and Brandy out during his performance. First, he would perform the single Poison with Drama and Wayne. Then he would perform the 'First Class' Remix featuring Brandy. <gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/-8WmtPJfH_U\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/-8WmtPJfH_U\n</div><figcaption><br><br><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/M9ptOdf6uqQ\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/M9ptOdf6uqQ\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The R&amp;B singer originally recorded the playful diss after <a href=\"https://www.billboard.com/music/rb-hip-hop/brandy-jack-harlow-first-class-freestyle-1235077208/\">Harlow failed to recognize</a> one of her classic songs, \"Angel in Disguise\", during&nbsp;his&nbsp;Hot 97 interview back&nbsp;in May.&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Speaking Jack Harlow, Hitmaka was recently on Clubhouse in Wack 100's Verzuz After Party&nbsp;room and gave him his flowers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"Look, I was Vice President of Atlantic Records I've seen Craig&nbsp;Kallman and all these other n**** step over the n***, and treat him like he was a regular artist,\" <a href=\"https://youtu.be/6d2YsQOb9-w\">said Hitmaka</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"He made his way up. He's a songwriter, he's dope, and all that other s***. He deserves everything he's got coming his way.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://youtu.be/6d2YsQOb9-w\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://youtu.be/6d2YsQOb9-w\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Earlier this month, Jack Harlow partnered with KFC on a limited edition meal. The Jack Harlow Meal, includes a KFC Spicy Chicken Sandwich, Mac &amp; Cheese, Secret Recipe Fries, a side ranch, and a lemonade. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“When KFC asked me to create my own meal, I knew it couldn't be just any meal. My meal brings together my childhood favorites  growing up in Louisville, the KFC, Mac &amp; Cheese, with my new go-to Spicy Chicken Sandwich (with plenty of ranch), Secret Recipe Fries, and lemonade—it doesn’t get much better,” Harlow <a href=\"https://www.restaurantbusinessonline.com/marketing/kfc-partners-rapper-jack-harlow-limited-edition-meal\">said in a statement</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></gwmw></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
